prompt_template:
Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE finished {ASPECT_RATIO} risograph illustration poster, warm cute everyday life. If the ratio is 9:16, compose a vertical scene; if it is 16:9, compose a genuinely horizontal landscape scene, never a crop, letterbox or padded portrait.

PRIORITIZED STYLE:
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}

PRINT: strict THREE INKS on cream paper #F4EBDD: warm orange #FF6C2F, olive green #5E6B3A, near-black #1E1E1E. No fifth ink: brown is ONLY translucent orange-over-olive overprint. Skin is pale orange halftone over cream, not pink/peach paint. Black ink confined to tiny eyes, thin round glasses, tiny label and slippers; hair and beard are bare unprinted cream paper, NEVER white ink; mouths/noses/object contours use olive or brown overprint. Orange and olive form broad masses. No blue, cobalt, pink, purple, yellow, white ink or gray wash.
Risograph printing MUST be visually evident: slight 1–3 pixel registration offset at 1500px short edge leaves thin paper/overprint edges, fine ink grain with mild patchy coverage, visibly coarse halftone dot shading rather than smooth tonal gradients, semi-transparent overprint at orange/olive overlaps yielding brown. Matte real ink on warm cream fibrous paper. Preserve rounded series silhouettes but replace all prior smooth airbrush with dot/stipple shading. No 3D, glossy light, digital smooth gradient, glow or photorealism.

CHARACTER: the same cheerful grandfather throughout this series. {SUBJECT} Short and stocky with a rounded block torso, thick soft limbs, relatively small bald head, prominent round fluffy beard, round orange nose and rounded soft hands with clearly connected arms; a slight comfortable stoop, never frail or sad. Wardrobe: {WARDROBE_STYLE}
ACTION: {SUBJECT_ACTION}
THE ONE OVERSIZED OBJECT: {PRODUCT_OR_PROP} Keep exaggeration ONLY on this single object, with the ordinary human and every other item at the series proportions.
SETTING: {LOCATION} Background: {BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS}
DESIGN INTENTION: {DESIGN_INTENTION}
RATIO PLAN: {RATIO_COMPOSITION} Apply only the plan for {ASPECT_RATIO}.

COMPOSITION: single scene, combined subject occupies 60–80 percent of image, substantial calm cream negative space. May crop the ONE giant object at edge; keep action, face and contact readable. Relaxed closed curved eyes or simple tiny black eyes, small nose and gentle smile. No surreal transformation, autonomous objects, abstract conceptual props, tension or cool fashion pose. One person only. No additional giant item, giant head, gigantic hand or extra limbs.
TEXT: exactly "{MAIN_TEXT}" once, no added punctuation, in one or two lines of TINY bold black sans serif in free upper corner, about 1.7 percent of canvas height, block no more than 25 percent canvas width; keep quiet, clear and separate from subject. No other wording, marks or brand. Secondary text: {SECONDARY_TEXT}. Accent symbol: {ACCENT_SYMBOL}. When either value is "none", render nothing for it.

SOURCE CONTENT TO REPLACE:
{SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}

Generate at highest available resolution, ideally 4K; preserve print dots, misregistration, grain and intentionally uneven ink. No denoising or sharpening.
